    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（中甲），非普通</em><br />穿着這套護甲期間，你可以以附贈動作讓這套護甲向四周釋放出劇毒的孢子，孢子將充滿以你爲中心的10尺半徑球狀區域。任何在這片區域內的生物都必須通過一次[[/save ability=con dc=15]]豁免，豁免失敗將陷入 <strong>中毒Poisoned</strong> 狀態，持續直至你的下一回合結束。此屬性一旦被使用，直到次日黎明前都無法被再次使用。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm 10pt\"><span class=\"GramE\">該護甲</span>主要由皮條固定的金屬護胸組成。儘管它並沒有爲四肢提供額外的防護，但其在保證着裝者活動自由度的同時，爲其生命器官提供了十分有效的保護效果。</p></div></div><p>While wearing this armor, you can take a bonus action to make the armor emit poisonous spores, which fill a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on yourself. Each creature in that area must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=15]] saving throw or have the poisoned condition until the end of your next turn. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p><p>This armor consists of a fitted metal chest piece worn with supple leather. Although it leaves the legs and arms relatively unprotected, this armor provides good protection for the wearer's vital organs while leaving the wearer relatively unencumbered.</p></div>",
